---
import ContactForm from './ContactForm.svelte';
---

<section id="contact" class="relative w-full py-24 sm:py-32 px-6 sm:px-10 lg:px-12 bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-200/80">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-start">
      <!-- Left Info Column -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#5194ea]/10 text-[#5194ea] border border-[#5194ea]/25 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
          Get in Touch
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-[#0f172a] tracking-tight leading-tight">
          Mari Bereskan Solusi Anda.
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-4 text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
          Punya masalah digital yang perlu dirapikan? Diskusikan dengan studio Sistemagis. Kami siap mendengarkan dan membantu Anda membangun sistem yang tepat.
        </p>

        <!-- Direct Channels -->
        <div class="mt-8 space-y-4">
          <!-- WhatsApp Quick Action -->
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/6281234567890?text=Halo%20Sistemagis%2C%20saya%20tertarik%20untuk%20membangun%20custom%20website%20atau%20sistem..."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/90 hover:border-[#8b5cf6]/40 flex items-center gap-4 transition-all group shadow-sm hover:shadow-md"
          >
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
              WA
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">Respon Instan</div>
              <div class="text-sm font-bold text-[#0f172a] group-hover:text-[#8b5cf6] transition-colors">
                Chat via WhatsApp Business
              </div>
            </div>
          </a>

          <!-- Email Quick Action -->
          <a
            href="mailto:hello@sistemagis.com"
            class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/90 hover:border-[#5194ea]/40 flex items-center gap-4 transition-all group shadow-sm hover:shadow-md"
          >
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-[#5194ea]/10 text-[#5194ea] flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
              @
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">Email Inquiry</div>
              <div class="text-sm font-bold text-[#0f172a] group-hover:text-[#5194ea] transition-colors">
                hello@sistemagis.com
              </div>
            </div>
          </a>

          <!-- Location Info -->
          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200/90 flex items-center gap-4 shadow-sm">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm">
              ID
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">Studio Location</div>
              <div class="text-sm font-bold text-[#0f172a]">
                Bandung, Jawa Barat, Indonesia
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-slate-200/80">
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 leading-relaxed">
            Estimasi waktu respon: <strong class="text-slate-700 font-semibold">1x24 jam kerja</strong>. Kerahasiaan ide dan data bisnis Anda dijamin sepenuhnya (NDA ready).
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Form Column -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <ContactForm client:visible />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
